  "_comment": "Genesis seed pack (Spanish) for the action map (V2-539). Every entry is an UNAMBIGUOUS, whole-utterance command mapped to one allowlisted direct action. Phrases are normalized on import (accents/punctuation don't matter here). Courtesy/word-order variants are separate entries ON PURPOSE — the matcher is not allowed to understand. When a phrase could plausibly mean something richer than the mapped action, it does NOT belong in this pack: the model handles it.",
